#: concepts/advantages.md:block 1 (header)
msgid "Advantages of using Ceno/Ouinet"
msgstr "Ceno/Ouinet 的优势"

#: concepts/advantages.md:block 2 (paragraph)
msgid ""
"The main advantages of using Ceno and Ouinet over other circumvention "
"technologies stem from the cooperation of clients and injectors to forward "
"traffic for one another, sign content for later verification, and store "
"signed content for seeding to others. Some advantages worth mentioning are:"
msgstr ""
"与其他翻墙技术相比，使用 Ceno 和 Ouinet "
"的主要优势源于客户端与注入器的协作，它们相互转发流量、为内容签名以供后续验证"
"，还会存储已签名内容并分发给其他用户。值得一提的一些优势包括："

#: concepts/advantages.md:block 3 (unordered list)
msgid ""
"**Familiar usage:** Accessing Web content using Ceno Browser feels quite "
"like surfing the Web on your habitual browser, even during complete "
"blocking. There is no need for new custom links to popular content, or "
"special actions from the user (like transferring files between applications)."
msgstr ""
"**熟悉的用法：**使用 Ceno "
"浏览器访问网络内容，感觉就像在你常用的浏览器上上网一样，即便在网络被完全封锁"
"的情况下也是如此。无需为热门内容使用新的自定义链接，也不需要用户进行特殊操作"
"（比如在应用之间传输文件）。"

#: concepts/advantages.md:block 3 (unordered list)
msgid ""
"**Increased availability of content:** Ouinet is able to provide content in "
"an efficient and trusted manner in situations of extreme network "
"interference. The more popular some particular content gets, the more copies "
"of it get seeded by Ceno/Ouinet clients, and the more available it becomes."
msgstr ""
"**提高内容可访问性：**Ouinet "
"能够在网络受到严重干扰的情况下以高效且可靠的方式提供内容。某些特定内容越受欢"
"迎，其副本被 Ceno/Ouinet 客户端分发的数量就越多，该内容的可访问性也就越高。"

#: concepts/advantages.md:block 3 (unordered list)
msgid ""
"Signed content may be brought into particular clients in a disconnected area "
"over offline means (e.g. a USB drive) and thus made available to other "
"clients."
msgstr "经过签名的内容可以通过离线方式（例如 "
"U盘）被带到网络不通区域的特定客户端，从而让其他客户端也能获取到这些内容。"

#: concepts/advantages.md:block 3 (unordered list)
msgid ""
"**Faster browsing:** Since your client can retrieve different parts of the "
"same content from various clients at the same time, the load of delivering "
"the content is distributed among different networks and devices, thus "
"avoiding clogging the paths to a single client (especially when delivering a "
"big resource like a video). This is not only useful when infrastructure "
"connecting to other countries is limited, but also for publishers to avoid "
"resource usage spikes at origin servers when some of their content becomes "
"very popular (the so-called [Slashdot effect][Slashdot effect])."
msgstr ""
"**更快的浏览速度：**由于您的客户端可以同时从多个客户端获取同一内容的不同部分"
"，内容传输的负载会分配到不同的网络和设备上，从而避免堵塞通往单个客户端的路径"
"（尤其是传输视频这类大资源时）。这不仅在连接其他国家的基础设施有限时很有用，"
"也能帮助发布者在其部分内容走红时，避免源服务器出现资源使用激增（即所谓的"
"[Slashdot效应][Slashdot effect]）。"

#: concepts/advantages.md:block 3 (unordered list)
msgid ""
"**Cheaper browsing:** Content popular in a particular region tends to get "
"copied in Ceno/Ouinet clients in that region, even if the origin server is "
"abroad. If you are interested in that content, your client will probably get "
"it from some other client in your region. In some countries where "
"international traffic is more expensive than local one (e.g. in the presence "
"of a [national intranet][National intranet]), this can actually save you "
"money."
msgstr ""
"**浏览成本更低：**在特定地区受欢迎的内容，即便其源服务器在国外，"
"往往也会被该地区的 Ceno/Ouinet "
"客户端复制。如果你想访问这类内容，你的客户端很可能会从你所在地区的其他客户端"
"获取。在一些国家，国际流量比本地流量更贵（例如存在[国家内联网]"
"[National intranet]的情况下），这种方式实际上能帮你省钱。"

